  m_Name: Object_172
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  partName: Heat Shield
  description: The Heat Shield is a thin-flat component made of Material.001, positioned
    at the middle-center-rear of the engine, serving as a protective barrier against
    excessive heat generated by the engine. Its tiny size and strategic location
    help to deflect heat and prevent damage to surrounding components. Interestingly,
    the Heat Shield is often designed with a reflective coating to maximize its heat-deflecting
    capabilities.
  audioExplanation: {fileID: 0}
